  "body": "Hi BitNet team, thanks for the great job!\n\nI know you've done a lot on your [fork of llama.cpp](https://github.com/Eddie-Wang1120/llama.cpp) and it's difficult to merge back to upstream due to conflicts, but is it possible to pull the latest upstream and apply all your changes as a patch so we can enjoy full functionalities of llama.cpp? \nI believe your latest code is in branch [merge-dev](https://github.com/Eddie-Wang1120/llama.cpp/tree/merge-dev) and involves changes to [34 files](https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp/compare/master...Eddie-Wang1120:llama.cpp:merge-dev).\n",
